          <p class="eyebrow">Child article</p>
          <h1>When school concerns may point toward ADHD</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            A teacher’s note about distraction or incomplete work can leave
            families unsure what to do next. This guide helps you compare
            patterns across settings and prepare useful questions.
          </p>
<div class="blog-answer"><strong>In short:</strong> A teacher’s note about distraction or incomplete work can leave
            families unsure what to do next. This guide helps you compare
            patterns across settings and prepare useful questions.</div>

        </section>
        <section class="surface panel">
          <h2>Questions worth asking</h2>
          <ul class="icon-list">
            <li>
              Is the difficulty happening across settings, not just in one
              class?
            </li>
            <li>Is there restlessness, forgetfulness, or task avoidance?</li>
            <li>Is school confidence starting to drop?</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </article>
    </main></div>
